,"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["02"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["HR"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["风险比。同样一段时间里，做了某件事的那组人出事（死亡、得病）的快慢，除以没做的那组。HR 0.87 就是比没做的那组低 13%，HR 1.21 就是高 21%"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-03","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["03"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["RR"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["相对风险。两组人出事的可能性之比，数字怎么读和 HR 一样"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-04","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["04"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["OR"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["比值比。也是两组的对比，只是算法和 RR 略有不同：要比的那件事很少见时，它和 RR 差不多；那件事很常见时，它会把差距说得比实际大"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-05","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["05"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["IRR"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["发病率之比。发病率是一段时间里新得这个病的人占多大比例，两组相除，读法同 RR"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-06","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["06"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["RaR"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["发生次数之比。比的是事情发生了多少次（比如摔了多少跤），不是多少人出事，读法同 RR"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-07","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["07"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["标准化死亡比"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["英文缩写 SMR。这群人实际死了多少人，除以「同样年龄的普通人本该死多少人」。5.86 就是死的人数是同龄人的 5.86 倍"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-08","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["08"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["风险差"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["两组出事的概率相减，直接得出「每一千人里多出几个」。倍数只说翻了几倍，风险差说的是实实在在多了多少人"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-09","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["09"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["95% CI"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["95% 置信区间。研究算出的数字总有误差，这是真实情况很可能落在的范围。倍数类的数字，范围跨过了 1；加减类的数字，范围跨过了 0，就说明两组的差别可能只是碰巧，文中会写「无统计学意义」"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-10","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["10"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["RCT"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["随机对照试验。用抽签一样的办法把人分成两组，一组做这件事，一组不做，过后比结果差多少。要证明「是这件事起了作用」，这种做法最有说服力"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-11","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["11"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["荟萃分析"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["把很多项研究的结果凑到一起重新算，得出一个总的数字。也叫 meta 分析"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-12","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["12"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["队列"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["队列研究。挑一大群人跟踪很多年，记录谁出了事。能看出两件事常一起出现，但不足以证明是前一件造成了后一件"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-13","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["13"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["观察性"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["观察性研究。研究者只在旁边记录，不安排谁做、谁不做。结果容易被别的因素带偏（见本表的混杂、反向因果两条），数字要打点折看"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-14","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["14"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["混杂"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["有第三个因素同时牵动着前因和后果，让两件事看起来像有因果。比如爱吃菜的人往往也更爱运动，分不清是哪一样在起作用"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-15","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["15"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["反向因果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["因果的方向弄反了：看着像前一件引起后一件，其实是后一件引起前一件。不是睡得多让人早死，而是病重的人睡得多"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-16","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["16"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["d、g"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["效应量，表示两组的差距有多大。把差距换算成「相当于几倍的常见波动幅度」：0.2 算小，0.5 中等，0.8 大"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-17","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["17"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["r"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["相关系数。两件事跟着一起变的紧密程度，取值从 -1 到 1，0.1 算弱、0.3 中等、0.5 算强"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-18","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["18"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["MET"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["运动强度的单位。安静坐着是 1 MET，快走约 3 到 4 MET。写成 MET·h，就是强度乘以做了几小时，表示一共动了多少"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-19","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["19"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["GRADE"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["国际上通用的一套打分办法，给一项证据有多可靠评级，分高、中、低、极低四档"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-20","lang":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-glossary-number"},"children":["20"]},{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["意向筛查分析"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["算效果时按「通知了谁去做筛查」算，不按「谁真的去做了」算。被通知的人里总有没去的，所以这种算法会把筛查对真去做的人的好处算低"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-glossary-row","id":"term-21","lang":"zh"},"childr